# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only needed files
**

# Re-include Go source files (but not *_test.go)
!**/*.go
**/*_test.go

# Re-include Go module files
!go.mod
!go.sum

# A local vendor/ directory is never used by the image build (see Dockerfile:
# modules come from `go mod download`). Excluding it keeps the build context
# small even when a developer has run `go mod vendor` for offline work.
vendor/
